@format 1
@id processing.start
@title Start processing
@area Processing
@entry input
@summary Workers are running or resumed and schedule observers see the new state.
@flow TB
@related processing.run-job
@tag processing
@tag start

@alias runner = Cadroue.ShellEngine.LRunner

[input] Start processing command <input>
- Receive the worklist control command @ runner.LRunnerStart(...)
> apply

[apply] Change runner state <process>
- Mark the runner active and start or resume enough worker loops for the configured parallel limit @ runner.LRunnerStart(...)
> result

[result] Runner state changed <output>
=Workers are running or resumed and schedule observers see the new state.
